&lt;p&gt;Our Wizards from all over the globe work together to protect the infrastructure of our customers, including over 65% of the Fortune 100, who trust us to scan and secure over 230 billion files daily. We’re honored to be a leading player in a massive and growing market, and we continue to look for exceptional Wizards who are eager to make a significant impact on our team. At Wiz, you’ll have the freedom to think creatively, dream big, and use your full range of skills to contribute to our momentous growth. Come join our team and help us create secure cloud environments that allow even the best companies to move faster, all while having some fun!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Minimum 5 years selling enterprise solutions, with a proven track record of managing accounts and meeting or exceeding sales targets at the enterprise level across the territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Consultative and professional approach to engaging with customers, with the ability to manage multiple opportunities across various stages simultaneously and pivot dynamically during meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience using CRM platforms (e.g., Salesforce or HubSpot) and the ability to quickly adapt to new tools, processes, and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Demonstrated ability to build strong internal partnerships across key business units, stakeholders, and sales operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies &amp;amp; Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent verbal and written communication skills, high resilience, flexibility, a positive attitude, and a strong commitment to working both independently and as a team player.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Interest:&lt;/strong&gt; A passion for sales and technology, with a strong interest in cloud security and cybersecurity solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience specifically selling within the cloud or cybersecurity ecosystem to elevate business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience operating and thriving in a fast-paced, hypergrowth, or start-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Methodology:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Deep understanding and practical application of structured sales processes and methodologies (e.g., MEDDPICC, Command of the Message).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;732&quot;&gt;About the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;746&quot;&gt;In this role, you will report to the Regional Director Sales. You will work alongside a team of Wizards that focus on our customer&#39;s business needs. Our priority is building a secure infrastructure for their cloud environments. We do that by learning their business. We ask questions. We listen. We help educate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate an intimate understanding of Wiz Cloud Security Solutions and their value to our customers &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate ability to position and advise to CISO level executives with industry Point-of-View business insights; Continue to listen, build and grow executive relationships with customers &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and close business to consistently meet or exceed quarterly sales quotas, in a way that reflects Wiz values &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with Wiz partner ecosystem to optimize market opportunity &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management with expert-level forecasting &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build effective working relationships with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Product, Marketing, Delivery, and Executive teams to ensure strategy alignment and achieve company objectives &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
